<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center" align=center><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt"><o:p><FONT color=#000000> </FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center" align=center><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt"><o:p><FONT color=#000000> </FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center" align=center><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt"><o:p><FONT color=#000000> </FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center" align=center><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt"><o:p><FONT color=#000000> </FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center" align=center><FONT color=#000000><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt">绍市人</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt">〔<SPAN lang=EN-US>2009</SPAN>〕<SPAN lang=EN-US>82</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt">号<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center" align=center><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 22pt; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt"><o:p><FONT color=#000000> </FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center" align=center><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 22pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt"><FONT color=#000000>绍兴市人事局关于组织开展<SPAN lang=EN-US>2009</SPAN>年度<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center" align=center><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 22pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt"><FONT color=#000000>事业单位工作人员考核工作的通知<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt"><o:p><FONT color=#000000> </FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt"><FONT color=#000000>市级机关各部门、各有关单位：<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt"><FONT color=#000000>为正确评价事业单位工作人员的德才表现，加强聘后管理，为事业单位工作人员岗位聘任、职务晋升、业务培训、调整待遇、实施奖惩等提供依据，特请各部门和有关单位认真做好<SPAN lang=EN-US>2009</SPAN>年度事业单位工作人员的考核工作。现将有关事项通知如下。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt"><FONT color=#000000>一、考核对象、内容、方法和程序按照《绍兴市事业单位工作人员考核工作实施办法》（绍市人<SPAN lang=EN-US>[2003]17</SPAN>号）的相关规定执行，优秀等次的人数根据单位实际在不同岗位、不同职务层次内合理安排，优秀等次人数一般掌握在本单位工作人员总数的<SPAN lang=EN-US>10%</SPAN>。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt"><FONT color=#000000>二、考核结果的运用与新政策有出入的按照新政策规定执行。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt"><FONT color=#000000>三、事业单位工作人员年度考核工作与机关工作人员考核工作基本同步，在<?xml:namespace prefix = st1 ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:smarttags" /><st1:chsdate w:st="on" IsROCDate="False" IsLunarDate="False" Day="31" Month="12" Year="2009"><SPAN lang=EN-US>2009</SPAN>年<SPAN lang=EN-US>12</SPAN>月<SPAN lang=EN-US>31</SPAN>日前</st1:chsdate>完成。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoBodyTextIndent style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal"><FONT face=仿宋_GB2312 color=#000000 size=5>四、各部门派驻便民中心和市长公开电话受理中心工作的事业单位工作人员，在中心工作半年以上的，由中心负责考核；在中心工作不足半年的，由派出单位负责考核。</FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt"><FONT color=#000000>四、《事业单位年度考核结果汇总表》和《事业单位年度考核优秀、基本合格、不合格人员名册》报主管部门审核后，于<st1:chsdate w:st="on" IsROCDate="False" IsLunarDate="False" Day="30" Month="1" Year="2010"><SPAN lang=EN-US>2010</SPAN>年<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>月<SPAN lang=EN-US>30</SPAN>日前</st1:chsdate>报人事局综合调研处备案<SPAN lang=EN-US>(</SPAN>联系电话<SPAN lang=EN-US>:85099812)</SPAN>。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt"><FONT color=#000000>各部门、单位要加强对事业单位工作人员考核工作的组织领导，规范实施，确保考核工作程序合法、结果公正，使考核工作成为激发工作热情的基本手段，成为奖优罚劣的有效依据。<SPAN lang=EN-US> <o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt"><FONT color=#000000>附件<SPAN lang=EN-US>1.</SPAN>事业单位工作人员<SPAN lang=EN-US>(</SPAN>专业技术人员<SPAN lang=EN-US>)</SPAN>年度考核登记表<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 72pt; mso-char-indent-count: 4.5"><FONT color=#000000><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt">2.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt">事业单位年度考核结果汇总表<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 72pt; mso-char-indent-count: 4.5"><FONT color=#000000><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt">3.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-width: 95%">事业单位年度考核优秀、基本合格、不合格人员名册<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 27pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312"><o:p><FONT color=#000000> </FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 216pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 27pt; mso-char-indent-count: 13.5; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><FONT color=#000000><st1:chsdate w:st="on" IsROCDate="False" IsLunarDate="False" Day="14" Month="12" Year="2009"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">二</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">〇〇</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">九年十二月十四</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">日</SPAN></st1:chsdate><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
